1. The game
-----------

**死神vs火影 绊 - 开放** (also known in English as *Bleach vs Naruto*, "BVN")
is a fan-made fighting game created by **剑jian** and **5DPLAY Game Studio**.
It is written in ActionScript 3.0 and distributed as a Flash/Adobe AIR
application.

This repository **does not contain, redistribute, or mirror any game code,
artwork, audio, or other assets**. Nothing under this repository's license
applies to the game.

Everything in the `game_patches/` directory is **our own original
ActionScript**, written to be injected into a user's *own* decompiled copy of
the game. Some scripts in this repository can read and modify files on the
user's machine; they operate only on the paths you point them at, and you are
responsible for having the legal right to modify your copy of the game.

If you want to use this project you must obtain the game yourself.

